        "Description": "Good evening 47, and welcome to an Russian army base in Moscow.  \rYou did a good job back then, IGAO is now completely disbanded. But now from the ashes to the new problems. The first target of the day is Cilas Netzke. Cilas is the army base director, and administrator. Then we have Kelly R. Edwards, he is protecting the main point of this mission, the important Russian papers, with a tag called &quot;Projector slides&quot;. Edwards is just the guard and the holder of them. Good luck agent. Have fun!",
